  "prompt": "Creating a collage of 12 images feels like {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"An unnamed student guitarist\"} Strolling{argument name=\"city\" default=\"Hongkong\"} These are snapshots taken casually with a smartphone. The collage should look like intimate, accidental snapshots and fragments of memory, rather than meticulously retouched commercial photography. Containing 12 images in a rounded 3x4 grid, each frame has slightly different composition and distance, showcasing rainy streets, traffic reflections, a mirrored selfie with a black electric guitar, close-ups of shoes, a hand playing guitar, details of a coffee table, convenience store glass, a harbor skyline, and a rain-soaked city nightscape. The girl is wearing {argument name=\"outfit style\" default=\"Black school uniform blazer, white shirt, black tie, plaid skirt, knee-high socks, and loafers.\"} Keep it{argument name=\"hair style\" default=\"Long hair with bangs\"} Add subtle effects only to certain parts of the scene.{argument name=\"fantasy element\" default=\"Angel Wings\"} It blends a dreamlike quality with reality. It emphasizes the imperfections of holding a phone, slight blurring, reflections, off-center composition, a damp atmosphere, soft, cinematic color grading, and a sense of scene that could easily be used as a music video interlude."
}

