  "prompt": "Create a 7-panel black-and-white comic strip in a hardcore neo-noir style, set against the backdrop of a Japanese alleyway on a rainy night. Utilize dramatic cinematic composition, bright reflections, heavy rain, dense urban details, realistic wet textures, and high-contrast lighting. The top panel shows the back of a young man in a trench coat walking towards a woman standing under a streetlamp in the distance. Japanese signs bearing the words \"Suntory,\" \"Sunrise,\" \"Hanazawa-dori 3-chome,\" and \"Yoru-giri B1\" are included, along with parked motorcycles and graffiti. The middle panel alternates between close-ups of the man's wet profile and the woman's profile, followed by close-ups of her face with speech bubbles. The bottom line shows a close-up of the woman saying, \"We don't have much time left,\" to which the man replies, \"Then let's get to the point.\" Finally, a distant view of a solitary figure in the alleyway is shown, accompanied by a large sound effect of the text \"tick-tock.\" Maintain the page entirely in grayscale, creating a strong atmosphere that is realistic and suspenseful, reminiscent of a mature young adult thriller."
}

